<mei xmlns="http://www.music-encoding.org/ns/mei" meiversion="5.0"><meiHead xml:lang="en"><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Pa 778-78-10</title></titleStmt><pubStmt><identifier>https://corpus-monodicum.de/d/6a1f2bb6-9923-40bf-8130-e10de44d5679</identifier><respStmt><corpName role="publisher">Corpus Monodicum</corpName></respStmt><address><addrLine>Domerschulstraße 13</addrLine><addrLine>97070 Würzburg</addrLine></address><availability><useRestrict auth.uri="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/">CC BY-NC 4.0</useRestrict></availability><date isodate="2026-11-04"/></pubStmt><seriesStmt><title>Corpus Monodicum</title><respStmt><resp>Edition (Sequenzen)</resp><persName>Andreas Pfisterer</persName></respStmt><funder>Akademie der Wissenschaften und der Literatur Mainz</funder></seriesStmt><notesStmt><annot type="document">eine ursprünglich bis f. 81v durchlaufende Sequenz wurde von einem Korrektor (=Notator?, jedenfalls regulär notiert) durch Einschub eines kleinen Blattes (f.99) in zwei Teile geteilt.</annot><annot startid="#m-12de2226-8951-4225-960b-7597af7c8da2" endid="#m-267c9ddb-6032-46d1-846e-f1ab8b8a83e7"><table><tr><td><rend>((admodum))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((amodum))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-752ec5a8-b345-45a8-b5bf-c261c3692d8a" endid="#m-b40d9149-f2a0-4adc-a818-c2a70697f3ba" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((nequeat))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((nequean)), korrigiert aus ((nequeant)).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-06d69d6f-933b-42c3-8566-022064782b12" endid="#m-a29f5b0d-c3e3-4813-a937-60324dbe4913"><table><tr><td><rend>((lepidis))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((lepidi))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-38319aee-45a1-41ee-acef-be9c71b14664" endid="#m-6e2fe323-b80c-4cba-8cc5-7b07edfd16ae"><table><tr><td><rend>((sui))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Buchstabe ((-i)) auf Rasur.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-677b268c-5355-4a80-a5d4-8644a868744c" endid="#m-19640c1a-86d7-4d19-a800-cf6dfd6ef844"><table><tr><td><rend>((fore))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((hore)) (?).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-f7523484-e999-410e-879e-ba240b248c12" endid="#m-4e4d5a71-1c99-4c24-96ef-a864d6126a1f"><table><tr><td><rend>((testamentum))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((testamenti)).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-5a00e4eb-3976-4bd2-a7da-47f58e857270" endid="#m-6c096708-7295-4e41-920d-877210d05dbf"><table><tr><td><rend>((Suum))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((Tuum))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-ece7b6bd-366a-4c71-81c5-0e452aa54fd7" endid="#m-8c696292-64b8-48aa-bff8-f69cc5c50b32"><table><tr><td><rend>((tamen))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>1. Buchstabe auf Rasur einer Initiale.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-3dca5700-3d86-48f8-a439-5a03775b3a08" endid="#m-dc7b0f06-b34e-4534-b8f9-6369b58b6486"><table><tr><td><rend>((cursim))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((cursum))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-8cf23275-2aff-4965-8698-422ab0ac771a" endid="#m-e366afdf-59ec-4d0f-af25-8491564a7a30"><table><tr><td><rend>((Seruati))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((Seruasti))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-82df0144-1b10-489b-8f29-6139321a948e" endid="#m-05ff07aa-0d9b-4c6a-a8a0-a1010c739b97"><table><tr><td><rend>((sumebatur))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((sumebantur))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-7596cedb-a843-48a4-b472-1d1a756f35aa" endid="#m-114610f2-5c26-4dc5-a7b6-1040e0534482"><table><tr><td><rend>((Faraonis magna))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Text auf Rasur, die Lesart vor Korrektur begann mit ((I)).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-8bdb99e8-9499-4ca2-8609-4b411b0fc548" endid="#m-6d055086-7ba6-4f70-993e-ebd1dbc83b86"><table><tr><td><rend>((Uidebitur))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Initiale korrigiert aus Kleinbuchstaben. Die Gliederung der Edition folgt der Parallelüberlieferung in ((Pa 1119)).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-1840e753-1d72-4390-bbbc-2a73f21b5fc4" endid="#m-88730bf6-1d6b-4a7a-8491-637d16cfd776"><table><tr><td><rend>((At))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Text auf Rasur.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-02e8e729-0653-49f8-8f80-3e3c8dfd056e" endid="#m-becd39d1-28ec-42cc-83bb-fecf731f12a0"><table><tr><td><rend>((gemma))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((gema))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-2fc872cd-98a1-42d0-9891-c3d5273e9016" endid="#m-46206e8a-c997-4582-bd2e-0996d2003c55"><table><tr><td><rend>((Mirray))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((Mesraym)) (hebräisch für ((Aegyptus))).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-9136a5f0-bdac-4cab-b055-de171d40db0f" endid="#m-84461421-2a6e-4a9e-930d-7b91d351d46d"><table><tr><td><rend>((rubrum))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>semantisch plausibler: ((rubum)) (wie ((AH))).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-df10f7a4-b60c-49b4-9b4c-f377190fac50" endid="#m-6e7bdeb8-8733-4680-8ce4-9e49aca5d08f"><table><tr><td><rend>((liminaria))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((luminaria))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-d85da35c-a021-47ec-ae44-4ee96960b367" endid="#m-d85da35c-a021-47ec-ae44-4ee96960b367"><table><tr><td><rend>((ac))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((hac))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot type="global-comment"><table><tr><td><rend>Eine ursprünglich durchlaufende Sequenz (vgl. ((Pa 1119))) wurde noch vor der Tätigkeit des Notators durch den Korrektor in zwei Sequenzen geteilt, dabei wurde ein Blatt (f. 79) eingeschoben, das den neuen Schluss der ersten (Strophen 12-13) und den neuen Beginn der zweiten Sequenz (((Splendent ecce)), Strophen 1-4) enthält.</rend></td></tr></table></annot></notesStmt><sourceDesc><source xml:id="wit-pa-778"><bibl><identifier type="siglum">Pa 778</identifier></bibl></source></sourceDesc></fileDesc><encodingDesc><appInfo><application version="0.9.1"><name>Monodi-Zero</name></application></appInfo></encodingDesc><workList><work><identifier>Pa 778-78-10</identifier><title>Praecelsa admodum</title><incip><incipText><p>Praecelsa admodum</p></incipText></incip><contents><contentItem><locus from="78">f. 78, l. 10</locus></contentItem></contents><biblList><bibl>AH 7, 71</bibl></biblList><classification><termList><term type="genre">Sequenz</term><term type="genre">Textiert</term><term type="feast">Messe</term><term type="Editor">Andreas Pfisterer</term><term type="Endseite">79</term><term type="Endzeile">3</term></termList></classification></work></workList><manifestationList><manifestation><identifier type="siglum">Pa 778</identifier><titleStmt><title>Pa 778</title></titleStmt><creation><geogName role="origin">Narbonne</geogName><geogName role="origin-region">Quellen aquitanischer Herkunft</geogName><corpName role="origin-institution">Kathedrale</corpName><date>12. Jh</date></creation><langUsage><language xml:lang="la"/></langUsage><classification><termList><term type="quellentyp">Tropar, Sequentiar</term></termList></classification><itemList><item><identifier type="shelfmark">Lat. 778</identifier><physLoc><repository><geogName role="settlement">Paris</geogName><corpName>Bibliothèque nationale de France</corpName></repository></physLoc></item></itemList></manifestation></manifestationList><revisionDesc><change isodate="2026-11-04"><changeDesc><p>Exported with Monodi-Zero 0.9.1.</p></changeDesc></change></revisionDesc></meiHead><music><body><mdiv type="main"><score><scoreDef><staffGrp><staffDef n="1" notationtype="neume" lin